ine, phenylpropanolamine, pimozide, pipamperone, posaconazole, probucol,† procainamide, promethazine, propofol, pseudoephedrine, quetiapine, quinidine, quinine sulfate, ranolazine, rilpivirine, risperidone, ritodrine,† ritonavir, roxithromycin, salmeterol, saquinavir, sertindole, sertraline, sevoflurane, sibutramine,† solifenacin, sorafenib, sotalol, sparfloxacin,† sulpiride, sunitinib, tacrolimus, tamoxifen, telaprevir, telavancin, telithromycin, terbutaline, terfenadine,† tetrabenazine, thioridazine, tizanidine, tolterodine, toremifene, trazodone, trimethoprim/sulfamethoxazole, trimipramine, tropisetron, vandetanib, vardenafil, vemurafenib, venlafaxine, voriconazole, vorinostat, ziprasidone" .
